                <invention-title lang="de">HUBWAGEN MIT MECHANISCH BETÄTIGTER AUTOMATISCHER BREMSVORRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">CHARIOT ÉLÉVATEUR AVEC DISPOSITIF DE FREINAGE AUTOMATIQUE ACTIONNÉ MÉCANIQUEMENT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">LIFT CART WITH MECHANICALLY ACTUATED AUTOMATIC BRAKING DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A lift cart (10) includes a lift table (22) that moves between a raised position and a lowest position and a braking device (32)_attached to the lift cart (10). A braking device (32) includes an actuator (34), a linkage bar, and a first brake assembly. The linkage bar connects to the actuator (34). The linkage bar translates in a first direction upon activation of the actuator (34). The first brake assembly connects to the linkage bar. The first brake assembly moves from a deployed state to a retracted state as the linkage bar translates in the first direction.</p>
